    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/*主播*/ &nbsp;明昔 &nbsp;Dayday</span></p><p><span>-----------------------</span></p><p><span>本期节目是《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66dbacfa0ff47a5e6620affe" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66dbacfa0ff47a5e6620affe"><span>听话听音</span></a><span>》和《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6533d54c2236d67cda9f99ce" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6533d54c2236d67cda9f99ce"><span>废墟拾光</span></a><span>》的串台，也是我们的播客年终盘点节目。</span></p><p><span>听播客很多年但时长不算长的明昔，和年头不长但时间巨长的Dayday，</span></p><p><span>我们因为播客结缘，今天就聊聊我们与播客的故事~欢迎收听</span></p><p><span>下期节目传送门：</span></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/695399412db086f897ce16b9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/695399412db086f897ce16b9"><span>年终特辑丨我们这些人，真是喜欢做播客呀（主播篇）</span></a></p><p><span>/*本期节目您将听到*/</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">03:20</a> 我们如何与播客结缘，从什么时候开始听播客</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 我们都听哪些类型的播客呢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1467">24:27</a> 印象深刻的节目</span></p><p><span>明昔：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ca2c5f3af97665afd52b4d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ca2c5f3af97665afd52b4d"><span>真实比例的太阳系</span></a><span> &nbsp;、 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60c1519feffed5948cc4a24e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60c1519feffed5948cc4a24e"><span>一周年：一路到底，做个东西</span></a><span> 、</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629cbe3a5cc037a5c6a7f6c3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629cbe3a5cc037a5c6a7f6c3"><span>九年。九个故事。</span></a></p><p><span>Dayday：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fb277d083a71a4eb0cff56" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68fb277d083a71a4eb0cff56"><span> 三十岁的独白</span></a><span> 、 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629361156c7eec4d0113cb31" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629361156c7eec4d0113cb31"><span>不婚也不恋、短期与开放，是这时代的婚恋观？！</span></a></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2233">37:13</a> 推荐的播客（热衷于推荐大台的我们）</span></p><p><span>明昔：天才捕手、故事FM、霓达播客</span></p><p><span>Dayday：出逃在即、哎哟嚯Radio、喜番调频</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3108">51:48</a> 我们的听播客年终总结</span></p><p><span>/*Song List*/</span></p><p><span>感谢你曾来过 - 杨宗纬/周思涵/张子豪</span></p>]]></description>
