    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/*主播*/ 明昔 &nbsp;&nbsp;/*嘉宾*/ 五哥</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期聊了聊长沙一座特殊的“山”---东瓜山，虽称呼为山，但却并不是山，而是城市中心的老社区，且听我们翻开这里被湮没的老故事，一起畅聊东瓜山的人间烟火。</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*本期节目您将听到*/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 长沙有座东瓜山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a> 东瓜山名字的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> 我们对东瓜山的“初体验”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="528">08:48</a> 东瓜山防空洞曾是长沙的“水果仓库”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 东瓜山的美食：香肠、炸炸炸、热卤...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">20:25</a> 东瓜山的建筑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a> 东瓜山的传说/历史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">37:23</a> 东瓜山的气功大师：侯希贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> 长沙的老字号美食</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*Song List*/</span></p><span></span><p><span>钟立风 - 东瓜山</span></p>]]></description>
