    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/*主播*/ 明昔 &nbsp;&nbsp;/*嘉宾*/ 一日、三三</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的家人们在今年盛夏自驾去新疆旅行，历时17天，行驶了超过万里的路途，一路美景美食不断，且听这趟旅行分享吧～</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS，邀请家人们上节目，真是忐忑呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*本期节目您将听到*/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 为什么会策划这段旅行呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 行程介绍（独库公路、赛里木湖、六星街、八卦城、火焰山、库姆塔格沙漠......）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 新疆印象，来了还想来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2550">42:30</a> 旅行吐槽&amp;小插曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2822">47:02</a> 大西北有点不一样（风俗、时差）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">50:12</a> 旅行准备（制定计划，必备品）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a> 旅行纪念品（不鼓励，但很有意义）</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*Song List*/</span></p><span></span><p><span>狼戈 - 苹果香</span></p><span></span><p><span>痛仰乐队- 公路之歌</span></p>]]></description>
