  <item>
    <title>Vol.36 生活太苦 来点儿脑腐 短剧套路大盘点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6888eccbedf3fa32d52099a8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6888eccbedf3fa32d52099a8</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Jul 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/*主播*/ 人间百草枯 明昔</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目是《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64f7ce8b37e1b72194cda03b" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64f7ce8b37e1b72194cda03b"><span>就决定是你了</span></a><span>》和《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6533d54c2236d67cda9f99ce" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6533d54c2236d67cda9f99ce"><u><span>废墟拾光</span></u></a><span>》的串台节目，也是两名主播蓄谋已久的一期。</span></p><span></span><p><span>由于一些录制时候的事故与脑洞，本期节目从一期变成了两期，现在大家看到的是上期节目，如果听完了之后大家觉得有兴趣，那么请于移步《就决定是你了》收听</span></p><span></span><p><span>下期传送门：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6888d2ecedf3fa32d51c5ca8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6888d2ecedf3fa32d51c5ca8"><span>vol.56短剧不光有脑腐，还有文化(但不多)</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>/*本期节目您将听到*/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 在录这期节目之前，我们“彩排”了一次。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="228">03:48</a> 什么是脑腐。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="341">05:41</a>我们为什么选择了脑腐以及我们选择了什么类型的脑腐。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> 我们看了什么类型的短剧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 要怎样才能成为一名霸道总裁，以及霸道总裁如何能遇到自己的“天命人”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2567">42:47</a> 真假千金到底是个什么路数。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3292">54:52</a> 怎样才能成为一名合格的穿越者。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5253">1:27:33</a> 我重生了！我要逆袭！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5439">1:30:39</a>系统是一个短剧必备时尚单品。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5753">1:35:53</a>古今交换物品：我给将军物资，将军给我古董和爱情！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5948">1:39:08</a>读心术与弹幕大法。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6244">1:44:04</a>娱乐圈题材的脑腐：综艺大咖与灵魂歌者。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6510">1:48:30</a>有好多“霸总”哥哥的宝贝团宠。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6976">1:56:16</a>短文短剧追起热点来简直太快了：从姜萍事件说起。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7554">2:05:54</a>有哪些你印象深刻的短剧演员？（重点表扬“邪恶老太专业户”李平老师）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6533d54c2236d67cda9f99ce/lsiSCGxSSlZX09GpO8baRkYd7nwP.m4a" length="198679613" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:16:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqPRFQE2Apm4TaODpH-4AEWqcWbd.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
