    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/*主播*/ 恒心</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*嘉宾*/ 明昔、Kunkun</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*剪辑*/ 明昔</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎关注：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Kunkun的公众号</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5NjM2NjA2Mw==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2228524288763101187&amp;scene=126#wechat_redirect" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5NjM2NjA2Mw==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=2228524288763101187&amp;scene=126#wechat_redirect"><span>《kunkun的小本本》</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>恒心的播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684dc49b4abe6e29cb26299d?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxNjNkMDdiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjMwNWI5NiJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684dc49b4abe6e29cb26299d?s=eyJ1IjogIjYxNjNkMDdiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjMwNWI5NiJ9"><span>星光日铺</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期是处于不同阶段的三位女司机之间的访谈。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有像明昔考完多年却把驾照放在抽屉吃灰的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>有像Kunkun一样平日会开车的，甚至敢长途自驾旅游的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有像恒心正处在新手期，既期待开车又对上路有点忐忑的；</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果正好有姐妹们听到的话，或许这期能给你带来一些开车的勇气，那么本期节目也算是有所收获啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*时间轴*/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 三位女司机的开车人设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 为什么想要考驾照？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 学车和考驾照时候的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3115">51:55</a> 三位所在的城市开车环境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3425">57:05</a> 讨厌的开车行为&amp;新手注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4217">70:17</a> 作为女性，在开车过程中会遇到的歧视/优待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4630">77:10</a> 想买什么样的车呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>---</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：王若琳 - 迷宫</span></p>]]></description>
