  <item>
    <title>Vol.33 职场转型丨38岁前4A广告公司客户总监，勇闯新赛道</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683f157831215eb506268cce</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683f157831215eb506268cce</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Jun 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/*主播*/ 明昔 &nbsp;&nbsp;/*嘉宾*/ 耿大牌</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对突如其来的裁员，本是不惑之年的耿大牌，却不得不面对这场职业变动的困惑，好在好心态助力着他走出阴霾，走向他用兴趣搭建的新生活，正如他所说，“我没有被打倒，但即使被打倒，也要有换个姿势重新开始的勇气”</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*本期节目您将听到*/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">02:35</a> 为什么要探索新赛道呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">05:02</a> 老广告人都去哪儿啦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="567">09:27</a> 广告公司其实是吃“青春饭”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 虽然突然，其实也是考虑过离职后的出路（开店、学习、进甲方...）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1042">17:22</a> 广告公司的有爱有恨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 职业空窗期，做过哪些探索呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2303">38:23</a> 烘焙相关的幕后故事（现在的面包好贵啊~）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a> 下一步计划？（边走边看，继续探索吧）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2988">49:48</a> 为什么会想做自媒体呢？（据说大多数广告人都做过自己的账号）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3265">54:25</a> 尝试新的方向，收获更多新的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 还想再回到广告公司吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4240">70:40</a> 对35岁+面临职业瓶颈的朋友们的一些小分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*友情传送门*/</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/556ec6cfe58d1307f2e790f9?xsec_token=YBlsrRnnJDFHKjK9VQE21RykKCloq6Sb15hxzriYgiNig=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=6040e92a00000000010046d7&amp;apptime=1748959624&amp;share_id=9b3bb4d1c8724851af00f93dc912180e" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/556ec6cfe58d1307f2e790f9?xsec_token=YBlsrRnnJDFHKjK9VQE21RykKCloq6Sb15hxzriYgiNig=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=6040e92a00000000010046d7&amp;apptime=1748959624&amp;share_id=9b3bb4d1c8724851af00f93dc912180e"><span>耿大牌</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>/*Song List*/</span></p><span></span><p><span>泥巴 - 陈楚生、杨坤</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6533d54c2236d67cda9f99ce/lp3XDMeYJzBOkoIq7VO3eif1MFSI.m4a" length="120352481" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:55</itunes:duration>
