  <item>
    <title>Vol.30 早餐吃点啥？早八人的味觉地图</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fe07dacdd692da156ac8fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fe07dacdd692da156ac8fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Apr 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>/*主播*/ 明昔 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;/*嘉宾*/ 大仑丁、大星</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>一期源于某人“连续吃了一整个月麦满分”（其实远远不止）而引发的热烈讨论，我泱泱大中华早餐那么多样，怎么能只独宠麦门一家呢？！本期节目邀请大仑丁和大星两位大朋友，一起聊聊我们各自生活地方的早餐，希望大家都拥有被美好味蕾唤醒的早晨φ(゜▽゜*)♪</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家记得吃早餐哟~</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*本期节目您将听到*/</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 吃一整个月麦满分是怎样的体验~（麦当劳打钱！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 我们的早餐人设</span></p><span></span><p><span>明昔：土生土长的湖南胃</span></p><span></span><p><span>大仑丁：天南海北都待过，全兼容的胃</span></p><span></span><p><span>大星：长在甘肃，喜欢吃肉就是好朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 湖南的早餐都是辣的吗？（各式各样的湖南米粉）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 大仑丁多种多样的早餐（请勿猎奇喝豆汁）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 兰州人的一天，从牛肉面开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1385">23:05</a> 一些“糊糊”早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2000">33:20</a> 休息日的早餐（自己做VS不吃）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2160">36:00</a> 麦门/K记早餐的小趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a> 没时间吃牛肉面怎么办</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a> 一些“手拿食”早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3051">50:51</a> 大星不爱吃早点，是因为...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3330">55:30</a> 心目中的完美早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3565">59:25</a> 吃牛肉面的tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3765">62:45</a> 边走边吃的面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3810">63:30</a> 可以自己DIY的早餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3935">65:35</a> 出门/国吃早餐的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4055">67:35</a> 一定要吃早餐呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>/*友情传送门*/</span></p><span></span><p><span>大仑丁 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6484a2a8e68894365ddb53d4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6484a2a8e68894365ddb53d4"><span>仑流发言</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>/*Song List*/</span></p><span></span><p><span>小行迹- 赵雷</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6533d54c2236d67cda9f99ce/lmAC597ADJRUReBuAugFuv-NSbIz.m4a" length="108997693" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqWv1x3n6Nn6UY8oe_mKJMum142K.png"/>
